            "body": "<p>That familiar 3 PM slump can make even a normal afternoon feel like a struggle. Sleep, stress, meal timing and glucose regulation can all influence how alert and energized you feel throughout the day.</p><p><strong>Think beyond another cup of coffee or sugary pick-me-up.</strong> Avonent combines Ceylon cinnamon, berberine HCl and MCT oil for a consistent metabolic-wellness routine. It's a smarter way to support your healthy habits while you work on the foundations of all-day energy.</p>",
            "highlight": "Support your routine without chasing quick fixes",
