            "heading": "Trusted by Over 100,000 Customers",
            "body": "<p><strong>Over 100,000 customers have chosen Avonent</strong>, and more than 10,000 five-star reviews show how much attention our Ceylon cinnamon formula has earned. Customers want a daily supplement that feels straightforward, thoughtfully formulated and easy to understand.</p><p>With authentic Ceylon cinnamon, berberine HCl and MCT oil together, Avonent makes it easier to choose a consistent metabolic-wellness routine without confusing labels or complicated ingredient lists. <strong>Join the growing Avonent community and see what makes the formula different.</strong></p>",
